  "markdown_content": "## Release Details\\nNaslen, who gained popularity among Telugu audiences with *Premalu*, is all set to return with another film \u2013 this time in a sports drama titled *Alappuzha Gymkhana*. Directed by Khalid Rahman, the Malayalam film is now gearing up for its Telugu release on April 25, 2025.\\n\\n## Reception\\n*Alappuzha Gymkhana* was originally released in Malayalam on April 10, 2025, and received a positive response for its content-driven storytelling and refreshing take on the sports genre. The film has been holding steady at the box office and is now aiming to make a mark with Telugu audiences.\\n\\n## Cast and Crew\\nThe film features a talented ensemble cast including:\\n- Naslen\\n- Lukman Avaran\\n- Ganapathi S. Poduval\\n- Sandeep Pradeep\\n- Anagha Ravi\\n- Franco Francis\\n- Baby Jean\\n- Shiva Hariharan\\n\\nThe film is produced by Plan B Motion Pictures and Reelistic Studios, with music composed by Vishnu Vijay.",
